# Clinical History is pasted from clipboard — set it once before running
# the script (copy your fixed template text so it's on the clipboard).
#
# These fragments are checked against the clipboard before a run starts,
# to catch the "forgot to copy the template" mistake before it silently
# pastes wrong/empty content into every order in the batch. Update this
# list to match distinctive pieces of your actual template.
